caption: Teams and Rank Maintenance

It is worth noting that, while we encourage adventuring in a group, ranks are individual. A group can take any job that their highest-ranked individual qualifies for, but remember, we don’t provide health insurance! Completing jobs with your higher ranked buddies is a good way to earn some cash and rank up quickly, but remember to know your limits: go too hard too fast, and you might not survive the landing! Rank does decay, as well, and Starbucks has a policy that, for all their contractors, they must complete at least one at-rank Mission once a month to keep their current rank. Failure to do so will cause you to drop one rank. This restriction is loosened to once a year at B rank, and removed entirely once you hit S rank. Shoot for the stars!
